== Trivia ==
* This item is used in {{chal|The Family Man}} and {{chal|Red Redemption}}, as well as the June 19th [[List of curated daily challenges|curated daily challenge]].
* Dad's Key may be a reference to Isaac's father leaving his mother, as it can be used to escape from almost any conflict.
* In ''Wrath of the Lamb'', this item was unlocked by beating {{e|???}} for the first time.
* The function of this item is very similar to the [[zelda:Magical Key|Magical Key]] from The Legend of Zelda.

